# Typography

Catalog: [`docs/TYPOGRAPHY.md`](../../docs/TYPOGRAPHY.md).

## Indices are a URL contract

The catalog order is the persisted numeric index for `titleFont`, `messageFont`,
`userFont`, and `prefixFont` — Display faces first, then Regular.

- **Append new faces only.** Never reorder without URL migration logic, or old meat-bag
  bookmarks wake up wearing the wrong typeface.
- Persist the **index**, not the family name. Legacy family-name URLs are still accepted
  and rewritten to indices.
- Adding a face means updating the table in `docs/TYPOGRAPHY.md` and importing it in the
  banner stylesheets before the picker is shown.

## Usage

Quote family names and always give a generic fallback:

```css
font-family: 'Better VCR', monospace;
```

The settings menu is always **Better VCR**; overlay fields may use any catalog entry.
These are third-party CDN fonts — if the CDN is down, browser fallbacks render the
overlay. Never block startup waiting for a font.

## Preferred fonts from the active theme

When a font param is absent, a font control is reset, the theme changes, or on
**Reset all**, resolve from the active theme's catalog entry before falling back to
Better VCR:

| Field role | Source |
|------------|--------|
| Title, prefix, user | theme `preferredDisplay` |
| Message | theme `preferredRegular` |

Meat bags can still pick any catalog face in the Fonts section.
